# Environment Variables — Amit Halder Portfolio

# Web3Forms Access Key (required for the inquiry form to work)
# 1. Create a free account at https://web3forms.com
# 2. Get your access key for askfor.amithalder@gmail.com
# 3. Copy this file to .env and fill in your key
# 4. Add the same variable in Vercel Project Settings → Environment Variables
#
# ⚠️  Never commit your real .env file to Git — it is already in .gitignore

VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=your_web3forms_access_key_here
